WEBVTT

00:01.574 --> 00:02.910
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.934 --> 00:04.270
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.294 --> 00:07.510
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.534 --> 00:13.094
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.094 --> 01:31.054
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.214 --> 01:34.454
=Episode 29=

01:42.404 --> 01:43.874
A cavalry seems to be approaching.

01:44.774 --> 01:46.030
It should just be passing by.

01:46.054 --> 01:48.694
Even if they want to kill me,
they won't do it on an official road.

02:02.724 --> 02:04.964
(Xuanyuan Qingfeng,
Only Daughter of the Xuanyuan Family)

02:09.574 --> 02:10.574
What's wrong?

02:10.604 --> 02:11.924
Do you know the woman?

02:12.904 --> 02:14.274
Xuanyuan Qingfeng.

02:24.004 --> 02:26.234
The Xuanyuan Family
of Hill Guniu of Mount Hui.

02:26.304 --> 02:26.924
Yes.

02:27.074 --> 02:28.394
The Xuanyuan Family of Jiangdong.

02:28.424 --> 02:29.424
Do you know it, too?

02:29.574 --> 02:30.604
Of course I do.

02:31.174 --> 02:31.931
The family

02:31.955 --> 02:33.430
has a foundation of hundreds of years.

02:33.454 --> 02:34.880
It controls the water transport

02:34.904 --> 02:36.074
of the world.

02:36.174 --> 02:37.580
There is an old monster in the family,

02:37.604 --> 02:38.604
Xuanyuan Dapan.

02:38.874 --> 02:40.034
He's reached Celestial Realm.

02:40.574 --> 02:42.810
Diamond Realm, Void Realm,
Celestial Realm.

02:42.834 --> 02:44.474
Is he of the same realm
with Wang Xianzhi?

02:48.324 --> 02:49.524
Xuanyuan Qingfeng?

02:50.054 --> 02:51.130
Isn't she the only daughter

02:51.154 --> 02:53.450
of Xuanyuan Jingcheng,
the eldest grandson of the family?

02:53.474 --> 02:54.604
Are you afraid of her?

02:55.154 --> 02:55.924
Afraid?

02:56.174 --> 02:57.354
Of course I'm not.

02:57.674 --> 02:58.794
Then why do you hide?

02:59.424 --> 03:03.004
During my three years of tour,

03:03.554 --> 03:04.954
Old Huang and I

03:05.254 --> 03:06.604
had met her.

03:06.974 --> 03:08.374
What did you do to her?

03:08.454 --> 03:11.300
Wasn't Wen Hua with us at that time?

03:11.324 --> 03:13.774
He thought Xuanyuan Qingfeng
was good-looking.

03:14.124 --> 03:15.454
So he complimented her a little.

03:18.604 --> 03:19.874
What did he say?

03:21.454 --> 03:22.994
He said something

03:23.774 --> 03:25.524
about her hips

03:26.474 --> 03:28.724
being suitable for childbirth.

03:33.204 --> 03:34.554
Wen Hua said that.

03:35.754 --> 03:37.754
Xuanyuan Qingfeng was unreasonable.

03:37.874 --> 03:38.994
She raced after us.

03:39.124 --> 03:40.554
It was just a misunderstanding.

03:41.774 --> 03:43.404
Swordsmen wandering in
the martial world

03:44.004 --> 03:45.554
should be generous.

03:45.924 --> 03:48.254
She was generous enough
to not kill you.

03:54.054 --> 03:55.054
Grandpa Wei.

03:56.054 --> 03:57.724
Follow the cavalry at a distance.

03:57.914 --> 03:58.914
Yes.

04:02.374 --> 04:03.924
What's that look?

04:04.324 --> 04:05.530
Didn't you try to avoid her?

04:05.554 --> 04:06.604
Why do you follow her?

04:06.854 --> 04:08.204
Her family is useful to us.

04:08.704 --> 04:10.430
The Xuanyuan Family controls
the waterways of the world.

04:10.454 --> 04:12.580
Mount Hui and Mount Longhu
are separated by a river.

04:12.604 --> 04:13.690
The family alone

04:13.714 --> 04:15.680
can stand up to the four
Longhu Arch-Taoists as an equal.

04:15.704 --> 04:16.704
What a high status!

04:18.304 --> 04:19.604
So Xu Xiao wants you

04:20.104 --> 04:21.354
to marry her?

04:21.424 --> 04:22.424
Absolutely not.

04:23.054 --> 04:24.224
To be honest,

04:24.304 --> 04:25.690
we're supposed to

04:25.714 --> 04:27.274
visit the Xuanyuan Family on the trip.

04:30.374 --> 04:32.254
It was a surprise that

04:32.454 --> 04:33.454
we met Xuanyuan Qingfeng.

04:33.504 --> 04:35.904
She seems to
head towards Mount Hui, too.

04:36.024 --> 04:37.904
Her family controls all the waterways.

04:38.154 --> 04:40.154
Why does she ride a horse
instead of taking a boat?

04:40.304 --> 04:41.714
Why don't you ask her?

04:53.954 --> 04:55.574
Xuanyuan Qingfeng?

04:55.774 --> 04:57.914
It's said
she and her father are at odds.

04:58.454 --> 04:59.834
If we follow her,

05:00.524 --> 05:01.764
we may find some useful things.

05:02.754 --> 05:03.754
Forget it.

05:04.354 --> 05:06.054
Let's kill Xu Fengnian first.

05:47.254 --> 05:48.254
We're just passing by.

05:48.374 --> 05:49.554
We mean no harm.

05:57.874 --> 05:59.404
You're quite combative.

06:01.424 --> 06:02.750
Nice armor.

06:02.774 --> 06:03.774
Nice move.

06:17.104 --> 06:18.144
Don't you attack us again?

06:20.154 --> 06:21.210
If I may ask,

06:21.234 --> 06:22.234
why did you attack us?

06:23.204 --> 06:24.250
Do we know you?

06:24.274 --> 06:25.504
I was just awake.

06:26.074 --> 06:27.074
I was grumpy.

06:28.604 --> 06:29.604
What about now?

06:31.124 --> 06:32.124
I can't kill you.

06:33.004 --> 06:34.004
I'd better sleep.

06:35.824 --> 06:36.824
May I

06:37.024 --> 06:38.024
know your name?

07:08.504 --> 07:09.504
Taking the shortcut,

07:09.574 --> 07:10.490
we'll return early.

07:10.514 --> 07:11.514
Take the shortcut.

08:12.324 --> 08:13.324
Make way.

08:17.324 --> 08:18.324
Go.

08:50.724 --> 08:52.154
Yuan Tingshan?

08:52.724 --> 08:54.430
(Yuan Tingshan, Retainer of the Xuanyuan Family)
Miss Qingfeng, are you going to the mountain?

08:54.454 --> 08:55.674
What if I am?

08:56.154 --> 08:57.430
Don't go.

08:57.454 --> 08:59.304
You're just a retainer of my family.

08:59.554 --> 09:00.780
How dare you stop me?

09:00.804 --> 09:02.400
I'm just following orders.

09:02.424 --> 09:03.424
Whose orders?

09:04.104 --> 09:06.400
Old Ancestor issued a transfer order
from Snowfield Guniujiang,

09:06.424 --> 09:07.254
commanding me to return.

09:07.404 --> 09:08.854
Who dares to disobey his order?

09:09.004 --> 09:10.004
Who do you think?

09:10.874 --> 09:12.354
Did my father send you?

09:14.124 --> 09:15.974
What if I must go back?

09:16.124 --> 09:17.394
You can't go back.

10:49.954 --> 10:51.204
They're all combative.

10:51.604 --> 10:52.754
Whose team is this?

10:53.354 --> 10:54.394
Who are you?

10:54.504 --> 10:56.834
Our young master came to save you.

11:03.354 --> 11:04.554
Could you tell me who you are?

11:15.324 --> 11:16.704
She is talking to you.

11:17.354 --> 11:19.304
Could I not show my face?

11:19.874 --> 11:21.854
In that case, why did you save her?

11:24.854 --> 11:26.004
Think about it.

11:27.174 --> 11:29.424
At that time,
I just gave her a little compliment.

11:30.154 --> 11:31.874
Wen Hua did that.

11:32.024 --> 11:34.054
She raced after us for a few blocks.

11:34.374 --> 11:36.524
Today I saved her life.

11:37.104 --> 11:39.204
We can call it even.

11:41.074 --> 11:42.574
I appreciate your help.

11:42.754 --> 11:44.354
Please let me say thank you
to your face.

11:51.104 --> 11:52.654
It's you!

11:58.474 --> 11:59.594
Stop there!

11:59.924 --> 12:00.674
Old Huang.

12:00.704 --> 12:01.570
Something's wrong!

12:01.594 --> 12:02.091
Wen Hua.

12:02.115 --> 12:03.394
Leave immediately!

12:04.224 --> 12:06.024
Miss, let me explain.

12:06.154 --> 12:08.004
Nice hips. Suitable for childbirth.

12:08.124 --> 12:10.004
Those are all compliments.

12:10.554 --> 12:11.514
Stop looking at me!

12:11.574 --> 12:12.554
Not just hips.

12:12.594 --> 12:13.610
You have nice waist, too.

12:13.634 --> 12:14.530
Willow, water snake,

12:14.554 --> 12:15.234
wasp,

12:15.274 --> 12:16.410
it's as slender and soft as them.

12:16.434 --> 12:18.074
Good figure. Great shape.

12:18.524 --> 12:20.254
I'll kill you, rascal!

12:24.004 --> 12:25.624
How are you, Miss Xuanyuan?

12:26.674 --> 12:27.674
Wait.

12:28.254 --> 12:29.330
You're mistaken.

12:29.354 --> 12:31.030
How could I be alone?

12:31.054 --> 12:32.370
Old Huang was with me,

12:32.394 --> 12:33.394
and Wen Hua.

12:33.604 --> 12:35.430
Wen Hua said all those words.

12:35.454 --> 12:37.370
I gave him a thumbs up at most,

12:37.394 --> 12:38.380
and echoed a little.

12:38.404 --> 12:39.810
He was the ringleader.

12:39.834 --> 12:40.410
You...

12:40.434 --> 12:41.434
Miss,

12:42.004 --> 12:43.610
I made friends carelessly.

12:43.634 --> 12:45.624
We were both victims.

12:46.404 --> 12:48.104
How dare you show up again?

12:49.774 --> 12:51.454
We have a bond, right?

13:06.274 --> 13:07.354
See you next time.

13:08.774 --> 13:09.774
Shu Xiu.

13:19.274 --> 13:20.274
Grandpa Wei.

13:20.424 --> 13:21.424
Rest assured.

13:27.254 --> 13:28.324
He can't escape.

13:30.474 --> 13:31.704
Who are you exactly?

13:58.474 --> 13:59.700
It was so close.

13:59.724 --> 14:01.474
You have no compassion for womanhood.

14:02.104 --> 14:03.120
I care about you in vain.

14:03.144 --> 14:04.150
Why don't you

14:04.174 --> 14:05.954
let me care about you?

14:07.074 --> 14:08.354
That's sweet.

14:19.554 --> 14:20.404
Did he run again?

14:20.524 --> 14:22.024
Dare he take liberties with me?

14:22.924 --> 14:23.714
He's right ahead.

14:23.904 --> 14:24.904
Go.

14:26.474 --> 14:28.274
Are you Xu Fengnian from North Liang?

14:31.104 --> 14:33.054
Everyone hates Xu Fengnian.

14:33.224 --> 14:34.624
Why do I want to pretend to be him?

14:36.474 --> 14:38.304
Who was the man that stopped you?

14:38.474 --> 14:39.594
None of your business.

14:40.804 --> 14:43.330
It seems that someone doesn't
want you to go back.

14:43.354 --> 14:44.474
Shall we travel together?

14:46.204 --> 14:47.754
It's a dangerous journey.

14:51.074 --> 14:52.324
Are you Xu Xiao's son?

14:54.354 --> 14:55.524
Have you

14:56.114 --> 14:57.454
just figured it out?

14:59.354 --> 15:01.034
So, you do

15:01.854 --> 15:02.924
look like him.

15:03.424 --> 15:04.434
What did you say?

15:05.024 --> 15:06.050
Are you going to Mount Hui, too?

15:06.074 --> 15:06.950
I'm going to Mount Longhu.

15:06.974 --> 15:07.850
On the opposite side of the river.

15:07.874 --> 15:08.554
All right.

15:08.724 --> 15:10.084
Let's go part of the way together.

15:21.924 --> 15:22.924
Where is he?

15:24.254 --> 15:25.254
Did he cross the river?

15:41.524 --> 15:42.574
Be careful!

16:13.674 --> 16:14.674
Thanks, Senior.

16:15.654 --> 16:17.174
Is it some swordplay or hidden weapon?

16:18.404 --> 16:20.474
Handle of the Big Dipper,
Peach Wood Sword Array.

16:20.524 --> 16:22.304
Why did you use a jade sword, then?

16:23.524 --> 16:24.850
Because it looks noble.

16:24.874 --> 16:26.404
Take the assassin to His Highness.

16:26.504 --> 16:27.504
Yes.

16:51.754 --> 16:52.754
No way.

16:53.454 --> 16:54.570
I gave him a push with all my strength.

16:54.594 --> 16:55.674
Even if he didn't die,

16:56.274 --> 16:58.474
he couldn't escape without a sound.

17:06.104 --> 17:07.114
Drop the act.

17:08.374 --> 17:09.394
You are conscious.

17:09.774 --> 17:11.010
If I want to kill you,

17:11.034 --> 17:12.234
I wouldn't have saved you.

17:13.674 --> 17:14.774
Why did you save me?

17:15.524 --> 17:16.900
The one you gave a sneak attack

17:16.924 --> 17:18.424
is Xu Fengnian of North Liang.

17:22.504 --> 17:23.604
If there is a chance,

17:25.354 --> 17:26.714
shall we do it again together?

17:30.074 --> 17:31.674
What if I don't join hands with you?

17:33.604 --> 17:34.924
I don't feel like forcing others.

17:35.874 --> 17:37.224
But think it clearly.

17:37.754 --> 17:39.210
You attacked him.

17:39.234 --> 17:40.834
Do you think
North Liang will let you go?

17:42.004 --> 17:44.074
Will the Xuanyuan Family
make an enemy of Xu Xiao

17:44.224 --> 17:45.874
just for a retainer?

17:48.274 --> 17:49.714
When do you take action?

17:58.904 --> 18:00.304
Let's talk about it next time.

18:01.324 --> 18:03.374
I hope you can live until then.

18:13.204 --> 18:15.074
Won't you wait for your men?

18:15.624 --> 18:16.954
They'll catch up.

18:18.104 --> 18:19.750
You're in such a hurry
going back to Mount Hui.

18:19.774 --> 18:21.074
Do you have anything important?

18:21.354 --> 18:22.354
Sort of.

18:23.274 --> 18:24.624
Who was the man that stopped you?

18:25.604 --> 18:26.604
Yuan Tingshan.

18:26.674 --> 18:27.824
One of our retainers.

18:29.654 --> 18:31.034
Dare a retainer stop his master?

18:32.524 --> 18:34.204
He probably followed my father's order.

18:34.374 --> 18:35.674
What else do you want to know?

18:36.854 --> 18:38.130
Will it be inconvenient for you

18:38.154 --> 18:40.274
to tell me about
the important matters of your family?

18:40.724 --> 18:41.724
Yes.

18:42.754 --> 18:43.754
Just ignore me.

18:47.424 --> 18:49.424
Do you try to meddle with our affairs?

18:52.474 --> 18:53.474
Have some water?

18:53.704 --> 18:54.704
No.

18:57.304 --> 18:59.374
Last time I was so angry with you

18:59.624 --> 19:01.274
that I didn't see your face clearly.

19:02.804 --> 19:04.074
There is nothing to see.

19:05.774 --> 19:07.274
Your face will

19:08.074 --> 19:09.554
please my mother.

19:14.654 --> 19:15.370
I...

19:15.394 --> 19:16.394
I'll take a break.

19:20.324 --> 19:22.554
Don't you think she is crazy?

19:24.924 --> 19:25.924
Xu Fengnian,

19:26.224 --> 19:27.224
tell me the truth.

19:27.504 --> 19:29.224
Have you

19:30.254 --> 19:31.650
met her mother?

19:31.674 --> 19:32.754
Definitely not.

19:34.204 --> 19:35.274
Let's get to the point.

19:35.904 --> 19:36.550
Senior.

19:36.574 --> 19:37.051
Yeah?

19:37.075 --> 19:39.115
Do you know the Old Ancestor
of the Xuanyuan Family?

19:39.204 --> 19:39.901
Yeah.

19:39.925 --> 19:41.704
Once at Snowfield Guniujiang
of Mount Hui,

19:41.954 --> 19:43.034
Xuanyuan Dapan

19:43.374 --> 19:44.634
had a fight with me.

19:44.854 --> 19:46.594
Is he still alive?

19:47.154 --> 19:48.011
Who won?

19:48.035 --> 19:49.604
I only lost to Wang Xianzhi.

19:49.974 --> 19:52.050
What realm did you say
Xuanyuan Dapan had achieved?

19:52.074 --> 19:53.074
Celestial Realm.

19:53.354 --> 19:54.594
How could he be the same as me?

19:54.954 --> 19:56.204
Does it mean he is good?

19:56.324 --> 19:57.490
It doesn't mean anything.

19:57.514 --> 19:58.874
What matters is fighting capacity.

19:59.454 --> 20:00.251
Kid,

20:00.275 --> 20:01.380
do you have designs on Mount Hui?

20:01.404 --> 20:03.724
The Xuanyuan Family
controls the world's waterways.

20:04.204 --> 20:05.354
It's very useful.

20:05.724 --> 20:06.804
How do you subdue it?

20:07.254 --> 20:08.074
Why don't you

20:08.254 --> 20:09.624
marry the girl outside?

20:11.624 --> 20:13.674
I will never sell myself.

20:17.624 --> 20:18.804
What's going on

20:18.904 --> 20:19.954
with her and her father?

20:20.674 --> 20:23.090
They're said to
have a very bad relationship.

20:23.114 --> 20:24.674
So she's away from home
all year round.

20:26.854 --> 20:28.704
Why is their relationship so bad?

20:30.054 --> 20:33.274
Her father is the eldest grandson
of their family.

20:33.424 --> 20:34.674
By rights,

20:34.954 --> 20:36.754
he should be in charge of
the family business.

20:36.854 --> 20:38.754
But all members of the family

20:39.204 --> 20:40.674
don't take him seriously.

20:41.354 --> 20:42.504
Why?

20:44.804 --> 20:48.350
(Cangwu Library,
Library of Xuanyuan Family)

20:48.374 --> 20:49.514
He likes reading

20:49.924 --> 20:51.364
rather than practicing martial arts.

20:51.854 --> 20:53.624
What's wrong with reading?

20:54.704 --> 20:57.050
After all, he is in a
martial arts family.

20:57.074 --> 20:58.674
He can't run family business, indeed.

20:59.054 --> 21:00.250
Except for not practicing martial arts,

21:00.274 --> 21:01.804
he is said to be weak

21:01.904 --> 21:03.024
and can't do anything great.

21:03.254 --> 21:04.254
He is a loser.

21:04.974 --> 21:06.200
Isn't he the same as you?

21:06.224 --> 21:07.654
What do you mean?

21:08.274 --> 21:09.410
You had a reputation

21:09.434 --> 21:10.610
as bad as him, didn't you?

21:10.634 --> 21:11.634
I...

21:13.104 --> 21:14.474
You're right.

21:15.804 --> 21:18.454
I might have a
worse reputation than he does.

21:19.024 --> 21:20.300
You're grim

21:20.324 --> 21:21.324
and hard to guess.

21:21.374 --> 21:22.810
Maybe it's the same

21:22.834 --> 21:24.004
with that guy.

21:25.204 --> 21:26.674
If so,

21:26.954 --> 21:28.594
he's even harder to guess.

21:29.604 --> 21:31.434
The key points are,

21:31.804 --> 21:33.924
why does Xuanyuan Qingfeng
return to Mount Hui

21:34.104 --> 21:35.424
and why does her father stop her?

21:35.524 --> 21:38.314
We can see through the whole game
if we figure it out.

21:39.074 --> 21:42.224
I think ever since
you met Cao Changqing,

21:42.954 --> 21:44.074
you've become much smarter.

21:46.754 --> 21:47.780
Sharp.

21:47.804 --> 21:48.874
You're a real queen.

21:49.154 --> 21:49.831
No.

21:49.855 --> 21:51.674
I'm always smart.

22:33.304 --> 22:36.150
(Xuanyuan Jingcheng,
Eldest Son of the Xuanyuan Family)

22:36.174 --> 22:37.874
You've been reading every day.

22:38.724 --> 22:39.874
What have you read about?

22:40.904 --> 22:42.394
The spirit of people,

22:43.004 --> 22:44.274
the mediocre life,

22:45.904 --> 22:47.654
the rights and wrongs,

22:48.424 --> 22:49.424
and

22:50.224 --> 22:51.434
the formless universal way.

22:53.124 --> 22:54.200
That's much.

22:54.224 --> 22:56.050
(Xuanyuan Jingxuan,
Third Son of the Xuanyuan Family)

22:56.074 --> 22:57.154
Does it do any good to you?

23:00.854 --> 23:01.854
Sure.

23:03.354 --> 23:04.354
I won't be distracted.

23:09.954 --> 23:11.404
You won't be distracted.

23:17.554 --> 23:19.074
I heard one thing just now.

23:20.574 --> 23:22.204
The retainer who uses a blade,

23:22.704 --> 23:23.754
what's his name?

23:24.524 --> 23:25.434
Yuan Tingshan.

23:25.474 --> 23:26.474
Yes.

23:26.854 --> 23:27.994
Yuan Tingshan.

23:28.604 --> 23:29.970
I heard he went down the mountain.

23:29.994 --> 23:31.154
Before he went,

23:31.454 --> 23:33.114
he seemed to have seen you.

23:33.374 --> 23:34.404
Yes, he did.

23:40.024 --> 23:41.024
Why?

23:41.324 --> 23:43.124
Do you want to stop Qingfeng
from coming back?

23:43.824 --> 23:44.824
Jingcheng,

23:45.104 --> 23:47.074
Old Ancestor picked your daughter
as his successor

23:47.474 --> 23:49.554
to inherit our family martial arts

23:49.954 --> 23:51.914
at Wending Pavilion of Snowfield.

23:52.124 --> 23:53.634
What good fortune she has.

23:53.904 --> 23:55.404
You sent someone to stop her.

23:55.624 --> 23:57.250
Are you out of your mind?

23:57.274 --> 23:58.314
As her father,

23:59.654 --> 24:01.130
I have to do something for her.

24:01.154 --> 24:02.874
There are many ways back home.

24:03.774 --> 24:05.274
How could Yuan Tingshan alone

24:05.724 --> 24:06.874
stop her?

24:07.504 --> 24:09.394
Will he just happen to run into her?

24:15.354 --> 24:16.914
Enough of jokes.

24:17.224 --> 24:18.474
I won't disturb you any longer.

24:19.354 --> 24:20.794
I'm going to visit my sister-in-law.

24:21.324 --> 24:23.174
By the way, she raises good fish.

24:23.354 --> 24:24.394
Have you seen it yet?

24:26.074 --> 24:27.074
I'm sorry.

24:27.654 --> 24:28.674
I forgot that,

24:28.924 --> 24:30.284
of all the people on the mountain,

24:30.404 --> 24:32.474
only you are not allowed to

24:32.854 --> 24:35.154
step into your wife's residence.

24:38.124 --> 24:39.124
Reading is useful.

24:39.474 --> 24:40.874
It keeps you from being distracted.

24:41.354 --> 24:42.554
So go on reading.

25:35.704 --> 25:37.724
Can't your young master
eat on his own?

25:44.074 --> 25:45.074
They're back.

25:48.654 --> 25:50.130
Your Highness, we didn't catch him.

25:50.154 --> 25:50.930
The guy

25:50.954 --> 25:51.801
is crafty.

25:51.825 --> 25:53.024
It doesn't matter.

25:53.254 --> 25:54.924
Down the river is Mount Hui.

25:55.354 --> 25:56.650
He doesn't have any chance
to stop her.

25:56.674 --> 25:57.674
What do you say?

25:58.654 --> 25:59.714
I'll have a walk.

25:59.824 --> 26:00.824
Enjoy yourself.

26:27.054 --> 26:28.054
Kid.

26:32.874 --> 26:33.874
Hey.

26:37.974 --> 26:38.974
Aren't you bored?

26:39.124 --> 26:40.124
Come out for a walk.

26:40.674 --> 26:41.974
Are you insane?

26:42.374 --> 26:43.351
Outwardly,

26:43.375 --> 26:45.504
I was taken away by Uncle Chess Master.

26:51.974 --> 26:52.974
What do you want?

26:53.754 --> 26:55.150
It's kind of fun

26:55.174 --> 26:56.474
to be here alone.

26:57.774 --> 26:59.994
But how do you relieve yourself?

27:00.904 --> 27:01.994
None of your business.

27:02.974 --> 27:04.080
Stop messing around.

27:04.104 --> 27:05.804
Listen to me first.

27:06.854 --> 27:07.854
Yes.

27:07.924 --> 27:09.610
Xuanyuan Qingfeng isn't wandering.

27:09.634 --> 27:11.650
There is someone skulking
in the direction she's going to.

27:11.674 --> 27:12.724
How do you know?

27:12.874 --> 27:14.974
It's hard to fool me
from such a distance.

27:15.904 --> 27:17.380
It's nothing that she wants to
meet someone secretly.

27:17.404 --> 27:19.504
After all, I have a bad reputation.

27:19.854 --> 27:21.554
The man she's about to see
is interesting.

27:22.124 --> 27:23.654
Do you know who she sees?

27:36.504 --> 27:37.554
Are you hurt?

27:37.904 --> 27:39.104
I was attacked by three people

27:39.274 --> 27:40.274
and got a blow.

27:40.854 --> 27:41.874
How badly it is?

27:42.924 --> 27:44.234
I may die.

27:44.854 --> 27:46.074
Really?

27:48.024 --> 27:49.624
It won't stop me
from going back, though.

27:51.374 --> 27:52.734
What order did my father give you?

27:52.874 --> 27:53.874
Don't hurt you.

27:54.654 --> 27:55.874
Don't let you go back.

28:00.054 --> 28:02.074
Then why Old Ancestor let me go back?

28:05.254 --> 28:06.800
You were chosen to
enter Wending Pavilion

28:06.824 --> 28:08.344
and be taught by Old Ancestor himself.

28:12.174 --> 28:13.624
It's terrific.

28:15.374 --> 28:16.954
My uncle didn't stop me.

28:17.254 --> 28:20.015
Why doesn't my father want me to
attain the highest level in one step?

28:20.154 --> 28:21.504
Your father was prepared.

28:21.904 --> 28:23.610
Those around you were all his informers.

28:23.634 --> 28:24.634
I know.

28:25.054 --> 28:27.170
Taking the shortcut, we'll return early.

28:27.194 --> 28:28.194
Take the shortcut.

28:31.404 --> 28:33.314
I took them out at one time.

28:33.624 --> 28:34.754
It was lucky.

28:35.374 --> 28:37.655
What was annoying was a lord's heir
coming out of nowhere.

28:38.404 --> 28:40.194
Why did you attack Xu Fengnian?

28:40.474 --> 28:41.474
I couldn't help it.

28:41.774 --> 28:42.914
What do you mean?

28:43.154 --> 28:44.574
I can't help but want to see

28:45.424 --> 28:47.544
what the superior lord's heir

28:48.594 --> 28:51.034
looks like when he dies.

28:51.374 --> 28:52.674
Yuan Tingshan,

28:53.474 --> 28:54.954
don't go crazy.

29:01.704 --> 29:03.104
Does my father have any reason

29:03.504 --> 29:04.804
to stop me from going back?

29:08.854 --> 29:09.874
He didn't say.

29:13.424 --> 29:14.424
Forget it.

29:14.654 --> 29:16.054
The general situation has settled.

29:17.074 --> 29:18.774
Go back to recuperate.

29:19.174 --> 29:20.754
I'll give you a chance in the future

29:20.804 --> 29:22.394
to learn our unique martial arts.

29:24.454 --> 29:25.454
Good.

29:26.024 --> 29:27.080
Take a shortcut.

29:27.104 --> 29:28.174
Don't let anyone see you.

29:28.674 --> 29:29.674
Go.

29:30.054 --> 29:31.394
I'll wait for you at Mount Hui.

29:46.304 --> 29:47.304
What are you doing?

29:48.754 --> 29:49.850
Why are you here?

29:49.874 --> 29:50.874
It's time to go.

29:51.374 --> 29:52.374
OK.

30:13.424 --> 30:14.794
There comes the news that

30:15.224 --> 30:17.204
my niece comes to the river.

30:21.174 --> 30:22.684
You've been apart for a long time.

30:23.224 --> 30:26.024
You should go with me to pick her up.

30:30.904 --> 30:31.904
Someone.

30:32.004 --> 30:33.324
Help him to go down the mountain.

30:33.804 --> 30:34.804
Don't bother.

30:36.604 --> 30:37.774
I can walk by myself.

30:38.854 --> 30:39.854
Please.

31:07.954 --> 31:09.954
How long has it been
since you came down last time?

31:11.074 --> 31:12.194
Can you stand well?

31:13.124 --> 31:14.524
Do you need someone to hold you?

31:31.554 --> 31:33.524
Are there people from Mount Longhu?

31:39.324 --> 31:40.434
Fishermen.

31:40.554 --> 31:42.130
It's near Mount Longhu.

31:42.154 --> 31:43.954
Everyone wears a Taoist robe.

31:44.654 --> 31:46.354
They have the strength of character.

31:48.854 --> 31:49.854
What?

31:55.454 --> 31:56.754
They look like fools.

31:57.854 --> 32:00.254
The Xuanyuan Family has stood
for a hundred years

32:00.924 --> 32:03.474
by courtesy and righteousness.

32:03.924 --> 32:04.780
Courtesy?

32:04.804 --> 32:05.804
Righteousness?

32:06.724 --> 32:08.604
Don't we need honor and shame?

32:08.924 --> 32:09.811
Jingcheng,

32:09.835 --> 32:12.150
do you read to get stupid?

32:12.174 --> 32:14.290
Our family has won dignity

32:14.314 --> 32:16.044
by hard fist

32:16.304 --> 32:17.834
and strong muscle.

32:23.824 --> 32:24.854
Look,

32:25.604 --> 32:26.924
they're coming.

32:35.474 --> 32:36.554
Is that your boat?

32:37.174 --> 32:38.674
Qingfeng, you finally come back.

32:39.224 --> 32:40.474
I come down

32:40.504 --> 32:42.754
to pick you up with your father.

32:42.974 --> 32:44.154
It's been years.

32:44.224 --> 32:45.954
It's time to come back.

32:47.654 --> 32:50.274
Old Ancestor wants to take Qingfeng
as his disciple.

32:51.594 --> 32:52.914
Who can stop him?

32:55.874 --> 32:57.010
Is the one with the biggest voice

32:57.034 --> 32:58.954
your third uncle, Xuanyuan Jingxuan?

32:59.324 --> 33:00.330
I heard that over the years,

33:00.354 --> 33:02.394
he has been in charge
of your family business.

33:02.504 --> 33:03.481
If nothing else,

33:03.505 --> 33:04.625
he's got quite a good voice.

33:04.774 --> 33:06.010
Thank you, Mr. Xu.

33:06.034 --> 33:06.650
See you.

33:06.674 --> 33:07.674
Already?

33:08.624 --> 33:09.624
Mr. Xu,

33:10.024 --> 33:11.580
we won't tread in muddy water

33:11.604 --> 33:12.830
or attach ourselves to North Liang.

33:12.854 --> 33:13.974
Let's say goodbye.

33:48.824 --> 33:49.914
Huangman'er.

34:13.704 --> 34:15.224
What is he looking at?

34:15.624 --> 34:16.624
Jingcheng,

34:17.354 --> 34:19.890
the guy who sent your daughter back,

34:19.914 --> 34:20.914
do you know him?

34:23.174 --> 34:24.524
I've never seen him.

34:25.004 --> 34:25.931
It must be another swordsman

34:25.955 --> 34:28.454
who tries to play up to us.

34:36.654 --> 34:37.654
Qingfeng.

34:58.074 --> 34:59.074
Huangman'er.

35:00.754 --> 35:02.054
Huangman'er.

35:05.754 --> 35:06.754
Fengnian.

35:07.074 --> 35:08.074
Fengnian!

35:08.354 --> 35:09.354
Fengnian!

35:11.104 --> 35:12.474
They're brothers.

35:15.654 --> 35:16.504
What a coincidence.

35:16.554 --> 35:17.890
He is really Young Master Longxiang.

35:17.914 --> 35:19.224
Isn't he afraid of water?

35:19.504 --> 35:20.504
Fengnian!

35:23.204 --> 35:24.204
Senior,

35:24.354 --> 35:25.354
give me a ride.

35:51.624 --> 35:53.450
I didn't expect my Snakes in Sleeves

35:53.474 --> 35:54.674
would become his mount.

35:55.054 --> 35:56.154
Charge him.

35:56.274 --> 35:57.274
Yeah?

35:57.304 --> 35:58.980
He must pay
for renting cattle and horses.

35:59.004 --> 36:00.444
Don't let him take advantage of you.

36:00.954 --> 36:01.954
Little girl.

36:04.204 --> 36:05.204
Fengnian.

36:06.074 --> 36:07.074
Fengnian.

36:09.904 --> 36:11.124
Aren't you afraid of water?

36:11.654 --> 36:12.904
Not anymore.

36:13.854 --> 36:14.751
On the mountain,

36:14.775 --> 36:16.504
some hawthorns are already ripe.

36:16.924 --> 36:18.230
Since then,

36:18.254 --> 36:20.700
the kid has been waiting for you
by the river.

36:20.724 --> 36:21.730
After some time,

36:21.754 --> 36:23.114
he isn't afraid of water any more.

36:23.774 --> 36:24.774
Awesome.

36:25.654 --> 36:26.654
Fengnian,

36:27.324 --> 36:28.324
fish.

36:28.754 --> 36:30.000
A guest must do as his host does.

36:30.024 --> 36:30.824
Let's have some vegetarian food.

36:30.974 --> 36:32.154
Don't embarrass your master.

36:32.474 --> 36:33.254
Don't worry.

36:33.324 --> 36:34.604
It won't embarrass him.

36:34.654 --> 36:35.724
He cooks fish soup.

36:36.054 --> 36:37.094
Fengnian, let's have fish.

36:38.704 --> 36:41.404
We can't have vegetarian food every day.

36:42.574 --> 36:44.750
Don't mention fish to other people.

36:44.774 --> 36:45.480
Don't worry.

36:45.504 --> 36:46.504
Nobody will mention it.

36:49.374 --> 36:50.530
Put the fish down.

36:50.554 --> 36:51.554
Yes.

37:01.254 --> 37:02.480
Zhao Xituan?

37:02.504 --> 37:04.454
One of the four Longhu Arch-Taoists?

37:04.524 --> 37:05.850
I heard Zhao Xituan

37:05.874 --> 37:08.624
took Xu Xiao's son as a disciple.

37:11.254 --> 37:13.254
Xu Fengnian.

37:15.304 --> 37:16.024
Hey,

37:16.254 --> 37:17.554
should we wait for them?

37:18.504 --> 37:19.354
Don't bother.

37:19.474 --> 37:20.474
They'll catch up with us.

37:20.554 --> 37:21.604
OK.

37:24.774 --> 37:25.751
How did your daughter

37:25.775 --> 37:27.654
know the son of Lord of North Liang?

37:29.774 --> 37:30.774
I have no idea.

37:30.974 --> 37:31.974
Let's go.

38:03.114 --> 38:04.114
Go back.

38:07.254 --> 38:08.954
You've been away from home for years.

38:09.204 --> 38:10.380
Now you come back.

38:10.404 --> 38:11.754
I feel relieved.

38:12.204 --> 38:13.624
Was the one with you

38:14.204 --> 38:15.574
Xu Fengnian of North Liang?

38:15.874 --> 38:16.874
Yes.

38:17.554 --> 38:18.954
Is he an old acquaintance of yours?

38:19.924 --> 38:21.010
We've met once.

38:21.034 --> 38:22.154
I don't know much about him.

38:22.504 --> 38:23.504
Really?

38:24.704 --> 38:26.424
Then why did he send you back?

38:27.054 --> 38:28.194
We just went the same way.

38:28.954 --> 38:29.904
(Mount Hui) Same way?

38:29.954 --> 38:30.854
(Mount Hui) Qingfeng,

38:30.954 --> 38:32.150
our family has been lasted

38:32.174 --> 38:33.424
for hundreds of years.

38:34.154 --> 38:35.514
We can't let others

38:35.704 --> 38:36.854
control our lifeline.

38:37.774 --> 38:39.034
Bright ideas.

38:42.024 --> 38:43.024
Uncle.

38:43.874 --> 38:44.831
(Xuanyuan Jingyi) Qingfeng.

38:44.855 --> 38:46.580
(Second Son of the Xuanyuan Family)
You surely have the honor.

38:46.604 --> 38:48.594
Your second uncle
usually doesn't show up.

38:49.174 --> 38:52.114
Tomorrow, Old Ancestor
will call you into Wending Pavilion.

38:52.354 --> 38:53.281
Uncle,

38:53.305 --> 38:54.354
I already knew.

38:54.674 --> 38:55.610
You should go tomorrow.

38:55.634 --> 38:56.634
Yes.

38:57.354 --> 38:59.010
(Mount Hui)
Your second uncle devotes himself to martial arts.

38:59.034 --> 39:00.354
(Mount Hui) On the mountain,

39:00.974 --> 39:02.330
except for Old Ancestor,

39:02.354 --> 39:03.554
he takes no notice of anybody.

39:05.354 --> 39:06.354
Qingfeng,

39:07.654 --> 39:10.194
you'll be Old Ancestor's
direct disciple.

39:11.374 --> 39:12.514
Our family

39:12.674 --> 39:14.594
may be handed over to you.

39:15.454 --> 39:16.371
Uncle,

39:16.395 --> 39:18.274
you're the real pillar of our family.

39:21.804 --> 39:23.854
You haven't seen each other for years.

39:24.754 --> 39:25.804
Have a good talk.

39:35.504 --> 39:36.430
I'm going to see my mother.

39:36.454 --> 39:37.454
Qingfeng.

39:37.874 --> 39:38.874
What can I do for you?

39:41.924 --> 39:43.974
What's your relationship
with Xu Fengnian?

39:48.504 --> 39:49.754
That's all you want to ask?

39:51.924 --> 39:53.074
If you turn to him,

39:53.724 --> 39:55.924
are you sure he will support you?

39:58.304 --> 39:59.854
Maneuver among various groupings.

40:00.674 --> 40:02.154
Did you read about it from some book?

40:02.554 --> 40:04.300
You want to trade me
for the support of North Liang,

40:04.324 --> 40:05.291
so that you can get the chance

40:05.315 --> 40:07.254
to take back
the power of ruling the family?

40:15.324 --> 40:18.224
(Mount Hui)

40:37.774 --> 40:40.804
(Mount Longhu Xiaoyao Temple)

40:41.454 --> 40:43.654
(Cultivate for Eternity)

40:47.124 --> 40:49.974
(Xiaoyao Pavilion
Clear Sky and Fresh Air)

41:12.204 --> 41:14.824
Mount Longhu Sect is number one
in the world.

41:15.204 --> 41:16.554
Why are you so poor?

41:18.704 --> 41:20.770
Arch-Taoists' Office is on the mountain.

41:20.794 --> 41:22.504
Worshipers all go over there.

41:22.704 --> 41:25.330
We don't have the good fortune.

41:25.354 --> 41:26.251
Why don't you live on the mountain?

41:26.275 --> 41:28.204
It's tiring to live with so many people.

41:29.024 --> 41:30.274
Besides, the kid

41:31.324 --> 41:32.930
isn't suitable to live

41:32.954 --> 41:34.624
at a disturbing place.

41:36.024 --> 41:37.700
Fengzi Battalion is stationed
outside the temple.

41:37.724 --> 41:39.024
We are at your disposal.

41:40.654 --> 41:42.400
Born to be Diamond Realm.

41:42.424 --> 41:43.830
He's the only one in the world.

41:43.854 --> 41:44.950
Your little brother

41:44.974 --> 41:47.180
will be invincible
by achieving Void Realm.

41:47.204 --> 41:48.430
Don't try to achieve Celestial Realm.

41:48.454 --> 41:50.130
It requires unity of heaven and man.

41:50.154 --> 41:51.774
I don't think he can endure it.

41:53.204 --> 41:54.480
My disciple is practicing

41:54.504 --> 41:56.100
Big Dream of Spring and Autumn.

41:56.124 --> 41:59.004
He can survive the calamity
of heaven and earth by the heart arts.

41:59.054 --> 41:59.804
Yeah.

41:59.924 --> 42:02.074
You care about your disciple very much.

42:02.424 --> 42:05.050
The direct disciple is more important
than my own life.

42:05.074 --> 42:06.074
God of Sword.

42:06.124 --> 42:07.204
Long time no see.

42:07.304 --> 42:08.470
Do you still remember me?

42:08.494 --> 42:09.624
Not really.

42:10.024 --> 42:11.024
It's me.

42:11.754 --> 42:13.480
Zhao Xituan of Mount Longhu.

42:13.504 --> 42:14.674
Is the fish ready?

42:15.154 --> 42:16.304
Almost.

42:16.554 --> 42:17.980
Please be patient for a while.

42:18.004 --> 42:19.004
Yeah.

42:19.804 --> 42:21.624
How could he not remember me?

42:31.504 --> 42:33.154
Don't wink at him again.

42:33.504 --> 42:35.104
Jiang Ni came in through the backyard.

42:38.504 --> 42:40.850
How could I not know there was
one more person in the carriage?

42:40.874 --> 42:42.074
Who else knows?

42:42.274 --> 42:43.074
Don't tell anyone.

42:43.254 --> 42:44.254
Of course.

42:45.824 --> 42:46.770
Jiang Ni?

42:46.794 --> 42:47.390
Yeah.

42:47.414 --> 42:48.414
How are you?

42:51.004 --> 42:52.004
Oh, my!

42:52.404 --> 42:53.424
Wait for me.

42:54.974 --> 42:55.994
What's going on?

43:29.834 --> 43:32.554
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.324 --> 43:37.124
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.054 --> 43:41.974
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.054 --> 43:46.854
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.154 --> 43:51.054
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.754 --> 43:55.574
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.574 --> 44:00.334
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.354 --> 44:05.274
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.774 --> 44:08.510
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.534 --> 44:09.774
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.554 --> 44:14.414
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.224 --> 44:17.950
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.974 --> 44:19.414
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.904 --> 44:23.774
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.204 --> 44:25.550
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.574 --> 44:28.414
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.824 --> 44:31.310
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.334 --> 44:33.734
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.024 --> 44:36.050
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.074 --> 44:38.250
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.274 --> 44:42.494
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.854 --> 44:43.990
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.014 --> 44:47.054
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.224 --> 44:49.190
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.214 --> 44:51.934
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.494 --> 44:54.310
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.334 --> 44:56.830
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.854 --> 45:00.954
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
